            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nTried to Cheat Us\nSep 2017 • Family\nThis is concerning the Phu My Hung location as I could not find it specifically here. On National Day, my wife called the KK hotline to ask about any deals. She then asked if the pricing was the same. Yes, they said, the same 2-tiered pricing was in use on this day.\n\nWe show up at the PMH location with 5 people and sat down. The manager came over and informed us that we had to pay the higher price (which gives one the 'right' to eat two day old sushi, etc) We said no, we were going to order according to the lower priced deal. He said no, they were not offering that price as it was a holiday. My wife informed him of her phone call, he still wanted to argue but my wife put an end to that very quickly. He reluctantly caved in and agreed.\n\nThe point is this; I refuse to be cheated by anyone and it's a disservice to the customers. I just wonder how many of the customers that day just accepted his dishonesty and paid more than needed be. Even if he was misinformed about his company's policy, it is unacceptable: get informed!\n\nI will not be going back for that reason.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 5, 2017",
